<a href="lepanel://v1/<panel title='Help (aggdef)'>
<section title='&#39;aggdef&#39; command' open>
<text>Find out where to set your aggdef slider to be 1/1
<font color=#FFFFFF>!aggdef &lt;attack time&gt; &lt;recharge time&gt; &lt;init value&gt;</font></text>
</section>
<text>If you are lazy, just use
    <font color=#FFFFFF>!weapon &lt;drop weapon into chat&gt;</font></text>
<text>Example:
    Your weapon has an attack time of <font color=#FFFFFF>1.2</font> seconds and a recharge time of <font color=#FFFFFF>1.5</font> seconds.
    Your melee/ranged init is <font color=#FFFFFF>1200</font>:
    <a href='chatcmd:///tell Nadybot !aggdef 1.2 1.5 1200'>/tell Nadybot !aggdef 1.2 1.5 1200</a></text>
<text><i>See <a href='chatcmd:///tell Nadybot !help syntax'>!help syntax</a> for an explanation of the command syntax</i></text>
</panel>">Help (aggdef)</a>
